{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARE YOU SKILLED ENOUGH TO TRAVERSE THE DEATH PIT?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep below the surface of The City's endless sprawl, something terrible festers. Six months ago, a gaping hole opened and swallowed an entire city block. Government-contracted drone operators attempted to explore the pit, but the operation was deemed a failure and the program ended.\u00a0Now, the drone-operating software has leaked online and many are trying to fly into the pit to uncover its secrets.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEATH PIT EXPLORER is a first-person precision-flight game. Your goal is to fly your drone to the bottom of the DEATH PIT. It will not be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS GAME-PROGRAM FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIX-DEGREES-OF-FREEDOM MOVEMENT: fly a drone freely in six directions through the DEATH PIT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNCONVENTIONAL CONTROLS: gain mastery to conquer the DEATH PIT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEADLY OBSTACLES: experience the white-knuckle thrill of precision navigation in the DEATH PIT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HAND-CRAFTED ENVIRONMENTS: witness the surreal locales of the DEATH PIT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HIGH DIFFICULTY: your skills will be put to the test, for there is no mercy in the DEATH PIT</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING this game may induce motion sickness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"DEATH PIT EXPLORED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603370/81288a5354b3df7daa047dd54e2c669414157168.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603370?t=1744830272","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603370